          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "question_types": {
      "value": "四选一文本问答；公开清理集3846题，不含正确答案键。论文旧4425题不得作为公开版分母。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/AstroMLab/Astrobench_MCQ_v1_Public",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        },
