          "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.17592",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "public_hidden_split": {
      "value": "HF名为train的split只公开题干与A/B/C/D选项，故意不含正确答案；它不等于供监督训练的完整标注集。提交预测至官方邮箱取得评测分数。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/AstroMLab/Astrobench_MCQ_v1_Public",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    }
